\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Remark}
\title{Trajectory compression and feedback acquisition}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{trajectory}

\p{The NExt construction \citef{chen2026lowrank} motivates a distinction
between following a predictable parameter path and acquiring information from
new rollouts. Low-rank dominance of saved differences does not imply linear
future motion, invariance across parameterizations, or preservation of
optimizer state.}

\p{A later theorem should charge checkpoint storage, decomposition, predictor
training, extrapolation, and recovery updates, then bound independent-evaluation
regret under explicit stability assumptions.}
